


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_e6973efe:



    voice "2HI_1378"
    hina "「我回来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_adea7f92:


    "阳菜和伦回到了宿舍。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_d2eb6138:


    "和白天说好的一样，文和圣夜子在途中与两人分开了，回来的只有她们俩。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_b0a9ee1c:



    voice "2HI_1379"
    hina "「浅生和圣夜子是要谈什么呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_44232cb7:


    "阳菜开着空调问道。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_385d0fb5:



    voice "2RI_1323"
    rin "「可能要筹划情人节吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_a7dfd349:



    voice "2HI_1380"
    hina "「这样啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_3c5be411:



    voice "2RI_1324"
    rin "「但多亏这样才有了两人独处的意外之喜嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_d101aeb5:



    voice "2HI_1381"
    hina "「是啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_f0684709:


    "阳菜一边解开围巾，一边无精打采地回答。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_e98019e0:


    "与状态良好的伦相比，阳菜似乎心不在焉。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_c66174d6:



    voice "2RI_1325"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_1f34edfe:


    "伦从口袋中取出项圈，悄悄靠近阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_4e9630b9:



    voice "2RI_1326"
    rin "「阳——菜？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_82b81fce:


    "她抚摸阳菜的同时如此说道。然后，她朝阳菜的脖子伸手，正要给阳菜戴上项圈——"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_39ddb896:



    voice "2HI_1382"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_ae0f7e07:


    "阳菜转过身去，躲开了伦的手。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_c557f162:



    voice "2RI_1327"
    rin "「啊咧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_4341314c:


    "伦拿着项圈，呆若木鸡。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_aae76d90:



    voice "2RI_1328"
    rin "「呃，项圈……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_70200251:



    voice "2HI_1383"
    hina "「想给我戴吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_95a34908:



    voice "2RI_1329"
    rin "「因为阳菜最近不是心情不好嘛？回来的路上也不怎么说话，感觉气氛很僵硬啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_00af5aa0:



    voice "2HI_1384"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_392892cc:



    voice "2RI_1330"
    rin "「所以，为了和好——」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_ae1be5df:


    "伦说着，再次伸出项圈。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_686b5df5:



    voice "2HI_1385"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_3748b879:


    "阳菜再次甩开头。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_eb6f2a54:



    voice "2RI_1331"
    rin "「诶，不做吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_2879a04a:



    voice "2HI_1386"
    hina "「今天不想做」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_e3f741dc:



    voice "2RI_1332"
    rin "「啊咧？为什么？为什么啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_19db67b9:


    "阳菜出乎意料的反应让伦陷入了混乱。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_c46145e9:



    voice "2HI_1387"
    hina "「我出趟门」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_d67be17f:


    "阳菜路过惊慌失措的伦，握住了房门把手。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_654ca48f:



    voice "2RI_1333"
    rin "「诶、等、才刚回来你就要出门？制服都还没换下来呢，你要去哪？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_b026483d:



    voice "2HI_1388"
    hina "「不知道」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_19fe6041:


    "阳菜走出房间。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_79e7f00d:



    voice "2RI_1334"
    rin "「诶？诶？诶诶诶！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_03_8cd1bbba:


    "伦手拿着空空的项圈，注视着房门，发出了困惑的声音。"
